BranchSelectScreen
  user picks "Computer Science"
  → setSelectedBranch("CSE")          // BranchOption.value

onNext("CSE") called
  → setBranch("CSE")                  // stored in formData.personal_info.branch

ResumeOptions receives
  branch = formData.personal_info.branch  // = "CSE"

getTemplatesForBranch("CSE")
  → looks up BRANCH_TEMPLATE_MAP["CSE"]  // = ["Modern", "Creative", "Classic"]
  → maps each ID to TEMPLATE_CONFIGS[id]
  → returns those 3 TemplateConfig objects

  BranchOption.value  ===  BRANCH_TEMPLATE_MAP key
     "CSE"          ===       "CSE"          ✅